---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
    title="Wellness & Team Retreats in Tucson | Himaya Garden"
    description="Wellness retreats, leadership offsites, and team building experiences in a beautiful garden setting. Reset, reflect, and reconnect in Tucson."
>
    <main>
        <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-cream pt-32 pb-20 md:pt-40 md:pb-28">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top,_rgba(132,147,118,0.18),_transparent_58%)]"></div>
            <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 xl:px-32">
                <div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr]">
                    <div>
                        <p class="section-label fade-in">Wellness & team retreats</p>
                        <h1 class="fade-in delay-1 font-serif text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-light leading-none text-charcoal">
                            Reset, reflect, reconnect.
                        </h1>
                        <p class="fade-in delay-2 mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone">
                            Retreat into a garden designed for renewal. From wellness weekends and leadership offsites to team building experiences, Himaya Garden provides the perfect container for transformation and connection.
                        </p>
                        <div class="fade-in delay-3 mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
                            <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Schedule a Retreat Consultation</a>
                            <a href="/events" class="btn-secondary">Explore Programming</a>
                        </div>
                        <div class="fade-in delay-4 mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-8 text-sm text-charcoal">
                            <div>
                                <div class="font-serif text-3xl text-sage">Flexible</div>
                                <div class="mt-1 text-stone">Group sizes</div>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <div class="font-serif text-3xl text-sage">Multi-day</div>
                                <div class="mt-1 text-stone">Formats available</div>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <div class="font-serif text-3xl text-sage">Customized</div>
                                <div class="mt-1 text-stone">Programming</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="fade-in delay-2 overflow-hidden rounded-sm shadow-lg">
                        <img src="/media/img/AG1_4.jpg" alt="Retreat gathering in nature" class="h-full w-full object-cover" />
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-warm-white py-20 md:py-24">
            <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 xl:px-32">
                <div class="text-center">
                    <p class="section-label fade-in">Why Himaya for retreats</p>
                    <h2 class="fade-in delay-1 font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light text-charcoal">
                        A setting designed for depth and renewal.
                    </h2>
                </div>

                <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
                    <article class="fade-in border border-sage/10 bg-cream p-7 rounded-sm">
                        <div class="mb-4 text-3xl">🧘</div>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal">Restorative space</h3>
                        <p class="mt-3 text-stone leading-relaxed">
                            The garden inherently supports stillness, reflection, and healing. It shifts people out of their everyday nervous system into a place of calm.
                        </p>
                    </article>

                    <article class="fade-in delay-1 border border-sage/10 bg-cream p-7 rounded-sm">
                        <div class="mb-4 text-3xl">🤝</div>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal">Connection catalyst</h3>
                        <p class="mt-3 text-stone leading-relaxed">
                            The intimate garden spaces and warm hospitality naturally facilitate deeper conversations and authentic connection between participants.
                        </p>
                    </article>

                    <article class="fade-in delay-2 border border-sage/10 bg-cream p-7 rounded-sm">
                        <div class="mb-4 text-3xl">🌿</div>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal">Nature integration</h3>
                        <p class="mt-3 text-stone leading-relaxed">
                            Outdoor spaces, natural light, and botanical surroundings support wellness programming, yoga, meditation, and outdoor workshops.
                        </p>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-cream py-24 md:py-32">
            <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 xl:px-32">
                <div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2">
                    <div>
                        <p class="section-label fade-in">Retreat types</p>
                        <h2 class="fade-in delay-1 font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light leading-tight text-charcoal">
                            From wellness to leadership, from team building to creative retreats.
                        </h2>
                        <div class="mt-6 space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone">
                            <p>
                                We support a wide range of retreat formats and programming. Our flexibility and commitment to hospitality means your retreat can take the shape it needs to serve your group.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="grid gap-6">
                        <div class="fade-in border border-sage/10 bg-warm-white p-6 rounded-sm">
                            <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-sage">Wellness retreats</p>
                            <h3 class="mt-3 font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal">Yoga, sound healing, renewal</h3>
                            <p class="mt-3 text-stone leading-relaxed">Immersive experiences combining movement, breathwork, and botanical healing in a supportive community setting.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="fade-in delay-1 border border-sage/10 bg-warm-white p-6 rounded-sm">
                            <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-sage">Leadership offsites</p>
                            <h3 class="mt-3 font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal">Strategic clarity and renewal</h3>
                            <p class="mt-3 text-stone leading-relaxed">Thoughtfully paced days balancing strategic work, reflection, and the kind of conversations that only happen away from the office.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="fade-in delay-2 border border-sage/10 bg-warm-white p-6 rounded-sm">
                            <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-sage">Team building</p>
                            <h3 class="mt-3 font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal">Connection and culture</h3>
                            <p class="mt-3 text-stone leading-relaxed">Experiential activities and shared meals that deepen team bonds and strengthen company culture in a beautiful setting.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-warm-white py-20 md:py-24">
            <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 xl:px-32">
                <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto">
                    <p class="section-label fade-in">The retreat experience</p>
                    <h2 class="fade-in delay-1 font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light text-charcoal">
                        Every element supports your retreat goals.
                    </h2>
                </div>

                <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
                    <div class="fade-in bg-cream border border-sage/10 p-6 rounded-sm">
                        <div class="text-2xl mb-3">🏛️</div>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal">Flexible spaces</h3>
                        <p class="mt-2 text-stone leading-relaxed">Indoor and outdoor venues for workshops, breakout sessions, dining, and gatherings.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="fade-in delay-1 bg-cream border border-sage/10 p-6 rounded-sm">
                        <div class="text-2xl mb-3">🍽️</div>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal">Nourishing meals</h3>
                        <p class="mt-2 text-stone leading-relaxed">Thoughtfully curated menus that support energy and wellness throughout the retreat.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="fade-in delay-2 bg-cream border border-sage/10 p-6 rounded-sm">
                        <div class="text-2xl mb-3">🧘</div>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal">Wellness integration</h3>
                        <p class="mt-2 text-stone leading-relaxed">Space for yoga, meditation, journaling, and personal reflection throughout the day.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="fade-in delay-3 bg-cream border border-sage/10 p-6 rounded-sm">
                        <div class="text-2xl mb-3">📋</div>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal">Full support</h3>
                        <p class="mt-2 text-stone leading-relaxed">From logistics to hospitality, we handle every detail so you focus on facilitation.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-cream py-24 md:py-32">
            <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 xl:px-32">
                <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr] items-center">
                    <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-sm">
                        <img src="/media/img/wellness-img.png" alt="Wellness retreat in the garden" class="h-full w-full object-cover" />
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <p class="section-label fade-in">Retreat planning</p>
                        <h2 class="fade-in delay-1 font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light leading-tight text-charcoal">
                            We handle the venue so you handle the content.
                        </h2>
                        <p class="fade-in delay-2 mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone">
                            Our role is to create the container — the beautiful space, the thoughtful meals, the seamless logistics — that allows your retreat facilitators to focus on the transformation and connection they're creating.
                        </p>
                        <ul class="mt-8 space-y-4 text-stone">
                            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-sage">◈</span> Custom retreat planning support</li>
                            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-sage">◈</span> 1-day to multi-day options</li>
                            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-sage">◈</span> Accommodations and meal coordination</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="relative overflow-hidden py-32 md:py-40 text-center text-white">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
                <img src="/media/img/AG1_4.jpg" alt="Retreat gathering" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
            </div>
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-charcoal/50 z-[1]"></div>
            <div class="relative z-[2] max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 xl:px-32">
                <p class="section-label text-white/80 fade-in">Ready to retreat?</p>
                <h2 class="fade-in font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-light leading-tight mb-6">
                    Let's create a retreat that transforms.
                </h2>
                <p class="fade-in delay-1 text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed mb-8 text-white/80">
                    Connect with us to discuss your retreat goals, explore dates, and design an experience tailored to your group's needs.
                </p>
                <div class="fade-in delay-2 flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center">
                    <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Schedule a Consultation</a>
                    <a href="/contact" class="btn-secondary border-white text-white hover:bg-white hover:text-charcoal">Request Retreat Package Info</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>
</BaseLayout>
